<DocsLayout title={title}>
<h1>progrok models</h1>
<p>Read the live model catalogs available to the current xAI account. <code>GET /v1/models</code> is the runtime authority; do not copy an old static list into automation.</p>
<pre><code>{`progrok models
progrok models --detail
progrok models --kind language --json
progrok models --kind image --json`}</code></pre>
<p><code>--detail</code> reads aliases and available metadata from the live catalog. <code>--kind</code> accepts <code>all</code>, <code>language</code>, <code>image</code>, <code>video</code>, or <code>embedding</code>. Use <code>--json</code> for scripts.</p>
<p>For Voice, <code>grok-voice-latest</code> is a rolling alias while <code>grok-voice-think-fast-2.0</code> is the reproducible pin and current <code>progrok live</code> default.</p>
</DocsLayout>
